@Becoming.«则之自反» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} (R : Becoming.«际» α), Becoming.«则» R R
@Becoming.«则之传递» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R S T : Becoming.«际» α}, Becoming.«则» R S → Becoming.«则» S T → Becoming.«则» R T
@Becoming.«及之传递» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R : Becoming.«际» α} {x y z : α},
