@Becoming.«一之续» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} (R : Becoming.«际» α), Becoming.«谓» (Becoming.«续» R Becoming.«一») R
@Becoming.«粗化» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} (R : Becoming.«际» α) {E E' : Becoming.«际» α},
