@Becoming.«亡于粗则亡于细» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} (R : Becoming.«际» α) {E E' : Becoming.«际» α},
  Becoming.«则» E E' → ∀ {x : α}, Becoming.«亡» R E' x → Becoming.«亡» R E x
@Becoming.«住于细则住于粗» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} (R : Becoming.«际» α) {E E' : Becoming.«际» α},
