Becoming.«亡于细者不必亡于粗» : ∃ α R E E' x, Becoming.«则» E E' ∧ Becoming.«亡» R E x ∧ ¬Becoming.«亡» R E' x
Becoming.«四相之定当且仅当排中» : (∀ (α : Type) (R E : Becoming.«际» α) (x : α), Becoming.«生» R E x ∨ Becoming.«有前» R E x) ↔
  ∀ (P : Prop), P ∨ ¬P
Becoming.«分叉» : ∃ α R a b c,
  Becoming.«相续» R Becoming.«一» a b ∧
    Becoming.«相续» R Becoming.«一» a c ∧ ¬Becoming.«相续» R Becoming.«一» b c ∧ ¬Becoming.«相续» R Becoming.«一» c b ∧ b ≠ c
@Becoming.«无环则及为序» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R : Becoming.«际» α},
  Becoming.«无环» R →
    (∀ (x : α), ¬Becoming.«及» R x x) ∧
      (∀ {x y z : α}, Becoming.«及» R x y → Becoming.«及» R y z → Becoming.«及» R x z) ∧
        ∀ {x y : α}, Becoming.«及» R x y → ¬Becoming.«及» R y x
@Becoming.«同族为类» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} (R E : Becoming.«际» α), Becoming.«类» (Becoming.«同族» R E)
@Becoming.«一之生» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} (R : Becoming.«际» α) (y : α), Becoming.«生» R Becoming.«一» y ↔ ∀ (x : α), ¬R x y
@Becoming.«一之下无复生» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} (R : Becoming.«际» α) (x : α), ¬Becoming.«复生» R Becoming.«一» x
@Becoming.«生生之展» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R E : Becoming.«际» α} {x : α},
  Becoming.«生生» R E x → ∃ y w, R x y ∧ Becoming.«生» R E y ∧ Becoming.«相续» R E y w ∧ Becoming.«生生» R E w
@Becoming.«生生最大» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R E : Becoming.«际» α} {S : α → Prop},
  (∀ (z : α), S z → ∃ y w, R z y ∧ Becoming.«生» R E y ∧ Becoming.«相续» R E y w ∧ S w) →
    ∀ {x : α}, S x → Becoming.«生生» R E x
@Becoming.«生生则复生» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R E : Becoming.«际» α} {x : α}, Becoming.«生生» R E x → Becoming.«复生» R E x
@Becoming.«一之下无生生» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} (R : Becoming.«际» α) (x : α), ¬Becoming.«生生» R Becoming.«一» x
@Becoming.«生住不并» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R E : Becoming.«际» α} {x : α}, ¬(Becoming.«生» R E x ∧ Becoming.«住» R E x)
@Becoming.«住亡不并» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R E : Becoming.«际» α} {x : α}, ¬(Becoming.«住» R E x ∧ Becoming.«亡» R E x)
@Becoming.«四相无自立» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R : Becoming.«际» α},
  (∀ (z : α), ¬R z z) →
    ∀ {x y z : α},
      R x y → R y z → Becoming.«住» R Becoming.«一» y ∧ Becoming.«生» R Becoming.«静» y ∧ Becoming.«亡» R Becoming.«静» y
@Becoming.«任一缘可为续» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R : Becoming.«际» α} {x y : α}, R x y → ∃ E, Becoming.«类» E ∧ Becoming.«续» R E x y
@Becoming.«蜡烛之合» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R E : Becoming.«际» α} {a c b : α},
  R a b → R c b → E a b → E c b → Becoming.«续» R E a b ∧ Becoming.«续» R E c b
@Becoming.«有常之逐点» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} (R E : Becoming.«际» α),
  Becoming.«有常» R E ↔ ∀ (u u' : α), E u u' → ∀ (v : α), R u v → ∃ v', R u' v' ∧ E v v'
@Becoming.«有常则续不尽» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R E : Becoming.«际» α},
  Becoming.«有常» R E → ∀ {y : α}, Becoming.«有前» R E y → Becoming.«有后» R E y
@Becoming.«有常则相续不尽» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R E : Becoming.«际» α},
  Becoming.«有常» R E → ∀ {x y : α}, Becoming.«相续» R E x y → Becoming.«有后» R E y
@Becoming.«有亡之续则不有常» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R E : Becoming.«际» α} {x y : α},
  Becoming.«续» R E x y → Becoming.«亡» R E y → ¬Becoming.«有常» R E
