@Becoming.«有常可复合» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R S₁ S₂ : Becoming.«际» α},
  Becoming.«有常» R S₁ → Becoming.«有常» R S₂ → Becoming.«有常» R (Becoming.«而» S₁ S₂)
@Becoming.«静有常» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} (R : Becoming.«际» α), Becoming.«有常» R Becoming.«静»
@Becoming.«核为类» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} (R : Becoming.«际» α) {E : Becoming.«际» α},
