@Becoming.«位核含于核» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} (R E : Becoming.«际» α), Becoming.«则» (Becoming.«位核» R E) (Becoming.«核» R E)
@Becoming.«亡于核下不变» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R E : Becoming.«际» α},
  Becoming.«类» E → ∀ {y y' : α}, Becoming.«核» R E y y' → Becoming.«亡» R E y → Becoming.«亡» R E y'
