  Becoming.«类» E → ∀ {y y' : α}, Becoming.«位核» R E y y' → Becoming.«生» R E y → Becoming.«生» R E y'
@Becoming.«位同则四相同» : ∀ {α : Type u_1} {R E : Becoming.«际» α},
  Becoming.«类» E →
